<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24373" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δημήτηρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τερος</span> and
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
		ἡ</span>: 
			Dor.
		, <i><span class="en">
			Arc.
		</span></i>, 
			Boeot.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαμάτηρ;</span></b>  also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δημήτρα</span></b>  Buresch <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Aus Lydien</i><i><span class="en">
				69
			</span></i>: acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δημήτραν</span> Epigr. ap.
				<i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.37.2
			</span></i>: gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαμάτρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					7.2793
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Copae</span>); 
				Aeol.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δωμάτηρ</span></b>  Hoffmann
				<i>Griechische Dialekte</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				2.153
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Aegae</span>); Thess. dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαμμάτερι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					9(2).1235
				</span></i>
			:—<i>Demeter,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.696
			</span></i>, al., once in <i><span class="en">Od., 5.125</span></i>,
				<i>h.Cer.,</i> etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> appell., as a name for <i>bread,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.463
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτή, καρπός.</span>
			(Variously expld. by Gramm. as, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γημήτηρ, δημομήτηρ</span>
			, or from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηαί,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κριθαί</span>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				265.54
			</span></i>.)</div>
